<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">- Makua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Attu o Ukolosai</para>
  <para style="toc1">Iwarakha i Napaolo wa attu o Ukolosai</para>
  <para style="toc2">Attu o Ukolosai</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ukol</para>
  <para style="mt2">Iwarakha i Napaolo wa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Attu o Ukolosai</para>
  <para style="imt">Malhove o uholhelha</para>
  <para style="ip">Iwarakha i Napaolo wa attu o Ukolosai yaalhepiye ni akarumiya Napaolo (nlhako wo 1:1). Yaalhempe ilha iwarakha ilha anari mu uttukiyani, veekinaka Urumi iyaakha yo 60 baada yo uyaria wa Kuristo. Iwarakha wa attu o Ukolosai vamoka ni iwarakha wa attu o Uefeso ni iwarakha wa Nafilimoni chineehaniya iwarakha cho mu uttukiyani, ukhalhawaya Napaolo yeyo ikatema iyo yaari anattukiye. Yaalhempe ilha iwarakha ilha wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo o iwani yo Ukolosai. Napaolo khayaachokhonlhe nlhoko wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo o Ukolosai, thoko chinohimia aya mu nlhako wo 2:1, nansho anene ayo phi nochuwelha yoyo mwaha uyo. Veekinaka tho, Naepaphra phi achokhonlhe yoyo nlhoko wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo uyo, ukhalhawaya aari ntu aakhumme Ukolosai uwo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Napaolo yaalhempe baada yo woona meettuchiho o woothachiya eettuchihiya Ukolosai uwo, ittu ipannge aya chinene valhempe aya iwarakha ilha. Inoonia wiira wahaawo nlhoko wa Ayahudi anrumelhenlhe Kuristo yaalhikacha waakhanyereriha attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo nanaya wiira attware malhehero e Iyahudi o Malhehano o khalhayi, hasahasa mwaha wo wiinelhiya unyawo. Napaolo anolhepa ahimiaka wiira, attu anrurmelhenlhe Kuristo kharina ittu ikina yo uttwara yaahikhalhe unrumelhelha Kuristo wiira yaalhakelhiye ni Nlhuku (nlhako wo 1:15-20) ni wiira meettuchiho a attu kharina maana (nlhako wo 2:8).</para>
  <para style="iot">Chiri nhina</para>
  <para style="io">Napaolo anochokholha iwarakha aya wo waashikuria attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo o Ukolosai (nlhako wo 1:1-2).</para>
  <para style="io">Tho, anolhepa ahimiachaka ipilhi ya Kuristo hasa mwaha wo uhiiwelhelha meettuchiho o woothachiya eettuchihiya Ukolosai (nlhako wo 1:3-3:4).</para>
  <para style="io">Thoko chiri aya mu iwarakha chikina chi, Napaolo anoolhepa chittu cho waalhaka attu ukhalha makhalhelho oombone anothananiya wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo (nlhako wo 3:5-4:6).</para>
  <para style="io">Napaolo anomalhiha iwarakha aya wo waavaha attu isalamu ni malhehero wiira iwarakha iyo ishomiye vaattuni mmilhokoni mwa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo (nlhako wo 4:7-18).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Mii Paolo, karumiya a Yesu Kuristo wo uttuna wa Nlhuku, vamoka ni munnihu Timotheo <verse eid="COL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />ninoolhepa iwarakha ni uwiiha uwaninyu ashilhoko ihu attu a Nlhuku, attu o ukhulhuvelhiya anrumelhenlhe Kuristo nri Ukolosai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 1:2">Kinoulhapelhelhani nnema ni mpuha ukhuma wa Nlhuku Athumwanihu ni Athithi Yesu Kuristo.<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Napaolo anonshukuru Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />Mahuku onkhaye vanoolhapelha ihuni ninonshukuru Nlhuku, Athumwanaya Athithi Yesu Kuristo, <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />ukhalhawaya niheewa mwaha wo nrima winyu wo unrumelhelha Kuristo Yesu ni mwaha wo waattuna winyu attu onkhaye a Nlhuku. <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />Uttuna ni nrima winyu chinokhulhuvelha ilhe yeesheriye inyu wiirimu. Ukhulhuvelha ulhe weewilhe inyu, vaapachenre inyu uhimeriya ikeekhene yo Malhove Orera. <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />Malhove Orera aaphilhe uwaninyu mwaatti, thoko chaari aya velhaponi vonkhaye ni waarukunusha attu mirima ahiye uwonya avire moombone ni wunnuwa thoko chiri aya uwaninyu mwaattiva toka nihuku veewilhe inyu mwaha wo nnema wa Nlhuku ni uchuwelha ikekhiaye. <verse eid="COL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />Epafra, namitheko nkhunanihu, namitheko o uttuniya a Kuristo wo nlhatu wihu owittuchinheni mwaha wo nnema wa Nlhuku <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />ahonihimeria mwaha wo uttuna nvaheriye inyu ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo toka veewilhe ihu mwaha unowaachani mwaatti nihokhalha ni ulhapelhakani ikatema chonkhaye. Ninonlhapelha Nlhuku wiira ovaheni irusho cho uchuwelha uttuna wawe, wo irusho ni uchuwelha unovahiya ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku. <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />Ninolhapelha chiicho wiira nkhalhe thoko chinothanana aya Athithi ni upanga chittu chinaaphwanelha. Makhalhelho o ukumi inyu upangeke moombone o kila nikosho no mitheko chorera ni wunnuwa ni unchuwelha Nlhuku. <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />Nlhuku wo wooria wawe wo nthimicho ovaheni machiri wiira nvilhelheke wo kila iphiro wo uhikhwa nrima, <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />nteelhiyaka mirima ni waashukuru Athithi oworinheni mwaattiva ukhalha ni mapuro awinyu eeshenre aya attu aya wi imwene yo unthukoni. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />Nlhuku ahonoopolha ukhuma ikuru yo mwiipiphini, nkaaniwiiha wi imwene yo Mwaamwanawe nonttuna awe. <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />Wo iphome awe yoyo ninowoopolhiya, ninoohiyereriya uwonya wihu.<verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuristo ni ntheko awe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Kuristo mwonne ihu we ikekhiaye phi nlhikaaniho na Nlhuku hinoonia. Yoyo ahaawo chittu chonkhaye chihinaya wuupiya. <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />Ukhalhawaya wo iphiro awe yoyo Kuristo uyo, chittu chonkhaye chahoupiya, cho velhaponi ni cho wiirimu, chittu chinoonia ni chittu chihinoonia, attu o ukhalhelha ihiche yo utawara ni mamwene ni attu o ikuru ni attu o machiri. Chittu chonkhaye chahoupiya wo iphiro awe ni wo nlhatu wawe. <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />Kuristo ahaawo vatulhi chittu chonkhaye chihinaya wuupiya ni wo ulhutaana ni yoyo chittu chonkhaye chiholhutaanihiya. <verse eid="COL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />Yoyo phi muru wo iruttu awe iri phi nlhoko wa attu anonrumelhelha. Yoyo phi machokholhelho o ukumi. Yoyo phi nttara o upacha uhihimmwa, wiira akhalhe phi machokholhelho o chittu chonkhaye.<verse eid="COL 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Ukhalhawaya Nlhuku ahottuna utimira wawe wonkhaye ukhalhe nhina mwawe Kuristo. <verse eid="COL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />Wo iphiro yo Mwaamwanawe, Nlhuku ahohokolhosha ilhapo ni chittu chonkhaye chuupiye. Ni wo iphome awe yaarihelhe vansalaabani ahowiiha mpuha nkaathaniha chittu chonkhaye velhaponi ni wiirimu.<verse eid="COL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Ni inyu mwaatti varachi mwaakhalha utayi ni Nlhuku, mwaari amalhaponi awe wo nlhatu wo irusho ni mitheko chinyu cho uhilhoka. <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />Nansho vano, nhomwaathanana Nlhuku wo iruttu yo Mwaamwanawe, wo iphiro yo nookhwa awe, wiira oholhelhiheni uwannyawe nnari atakatifu wo uhikhalha ni nlhatu wo ulhaphachiya. <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />Nthepaka ulhokelha mu nsingi wo ukhomaalha wo munrimani, mena nhitikhinye ni uhiya ukhulhuvelha upantte inyu veewilhe inyu Malhove Orera ahimiachiye wo kila ntu wuuthi irimu, velhaponi va. Nlhove kithanlhiye aka mii Paolo ukhalha namitheko aya.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntheko u Napaolo wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Vano etu, kinooteelhiya nrima vanohuva aka wo nlhatu winyu, ukhalhawaya wo uhuvihiya waka, kinotimiriha mwiiruttuni mwaka awukuwilhe uhuvihiya wa Kuristo iruttu awe iri wa attu onkhaye anonrumelhelha Kuristo. <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />Ni mii kihopangiya ni Nlhuku ukhalha namitheko a attu anrumelhenlhe Yesu kivare ntheko wo umalhiha uhimiacha nttenga awe wo utimira. <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />Yoyo nttenga uyo wahovithiya wiira attu ahichuwelhe toka mahuku o uhimalha, nansho vano uhopatakulhiya wa attu awe. <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />Nlhuku hothanana waapatakulhelha attu awe, nhakhu ni nthimicho wo nlhove nivithiye nno niwanelhe wa attu o velhaponi. Nlhove nivithiye nno phi Kuristo ri nhina mwinyu, ni hii nnookhulhuvelha ukhalha nhina nthimicho wa Nlhuku.<verse eid="COL 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu ninonhimiacha Kuristo wa attu onkhaye, wo irusho chonkhaye, ninomwaamuka ni umwiittuchiha kila ntu wiira ninrweehe kila mmoka mmiholho wa Nlhuku nakhomanlhe muulhutaanani ni Kuristo. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Wo yayo malhakelho o uhimiacha yoyo mwaha uyo, kinoomananiha ni ukuruvalhelha wo machiri kivanhe awe Kuristo anopanga ntheko nhina mwaka.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Kinothanana nchuwelheke chineera aka wo ukuruvalhelha upanga ntheko wo nlhatu winyu ni wo nlhatu wa attu o Ulaodikiya ni wo nlhatu wa attu onkhaye ahinapacha woona iruttu aka. <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />Kinopanga chiicho mwayini wiira ahelhiye mirima ni ulhutaanihiya muuttunani, acharihiye irusho che ikeekhene wiira achuwelhe we ikekhiaye nlhove nivithiye na Nlhuku yaani Kuristo mwanene. <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />Nhina mwaya chihovithiya mihakhu chonkhaye cho irusho ni cho uchuwelha.<verse eid="COL 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Paahi etu, kinouhimeriani wiira nhithepiye ni ntu riyoothe wo malhove o woothachiya anakhalhaka o uchiva chinene. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Ukhalhawaya, anakhalhaka iruttu aka rii utayi ni mwaattiva, nansho munrimani mwaka kiri vamoka ni inyu mwaatti, kiteelhiyaka uwoonani nheemelha rata unrumelhelhani Kuristo.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukumi we ikeekhene wo ulhutaana ni Kuristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Ukhalhawaya thoko chinrumelhenlhe inyu Kuristo Yesu ukhalha Athithi, paahi etu nkhalheke wo ulhutaana ni uyo. <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />Mmelheke mithithaari nhina mwawe, ukumi inyu wiithekeke vachulhu wawe ni nrima inyu weemelheke rata thoko chiittuchihiye inyu. Nkhalheke attu o ushukuru chinene.<verse eid="COL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Mmwehechesheke, ntu hupangeni ipotta wo malhove o woothacha o irusho cho attu anokhulhuvelha meettuchiho o malhehero a attu ni o mashoka anotawara ilhapo, ni mena ahikhumaka wa Kuristo mwanene! <verse eid="COL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Ukhalhawaya, utimira wonkhaye wa Nlhuku urii nhina mwawe Kuristo, mwiiruttuni mwawe. <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />Ni inyu mwaatti nhovahiya ukumi utiminre wo ulhutaana ni uyo rii muru, vachulhu mashoka onkhaye anotawara ni o ikuru onkhaye.<verse eid="COL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Wo ulhutaana ni Kuristo mwaattiva mwaheenelhiya unyawo wo urulha iruttu yo uwonya. Uhipangiye wo miono cha attu, nansho unyawo uneeniya ni Kuristo mwanene. Ni wowo phi woopolhiya ukhuma uttu wo uwonya. <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />Ikatema vaabatiiziye inyu mwaahovithiya vamoka ni Kuristo. Ni wo ubatiiziya uwo mwaattiva chiicho mwahohihimushiya wo urumelhelha machiri a Nlhuku anhihimunshe Kuristo nnookhwani. <verse eid="COL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Mwaari thoko nnakwilhe wo nlhatu wo uwonya winyu ni uhiinelhiya iruttu inyu. Nansho Nlhuku hoovahani ukumi vamoka ni Kuristo. Nlhuku honihiyerera uwonya wihu wonkhaye, <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />vaamalhinhe awe ufuta malhove o milhatu chaari chaanikhalhelha ni malhehero aya, we ikekhiaye ahothamiha onkhaye nkaakhomelhelha vansalaabani. <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Vavawo vansalaabani vawo Kuristo ahaathurulha machiri mashoka o utawara ayo ni olhupalhe o ikuru, nkoolhihacha muru voonene wo waapurulhacha mumphingoni thoko mateeka avariye ukhotoni wooniha wiira haakottolha.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Paahi etu nhihukumulhiye ni ntu riyoothe vachulhu mwaha unaacha cholhia ama chittu cho uwuria ama mahuku o sikuukuu ama isikuukuu yo woonia mweeri ama unaacha Nihuku no Wiittuwa. <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Yoyo mwaha wonkhaye uyo phi irungu yo mwaha unowa ulhe, nansho ikekhiaye inene iyo phi iruttu ya Kuristo. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Nhirumelhelhe uhukumulhiya ni ntu riyoothe neechoona ukhalha o maana wo nlhatu wo ulhohera wo yekha awe, nokurumicha mwaha wo wiitimarikha wo woothiya ni uthimicha minepa o wiirimu. Ntu thoko yoyo neefunelha irusho choothepiacha cho mwiiruttuni mwawe. <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />Yoyo heemwalhaaniha ni Kuristo ri muru o iruttu iyo. Wo iphiro awe Kuristo uyo, iruttu yonkhaye inoolhihiya ni uvaraanihiya vamoka wo ulhutaanihiya ni mithinga chaya, ni wunnuwa thoko chinothanana awe Nlhuku.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukhwa ni ukhalha vamoka ni Kuristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />Mwaattiva nhokhwa vamoka ni Kuristo ni woopolhiya ukhuma machiri o mashoka anotawara ilhapo. Wo nlhatu waani etu nnokhalha tho thoko attu o ilha ilhapo ilha? Ye ishiyani weesheriya malheheriyo wiira, <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />“nhivare ilha ama nhilhawihe ilhe ama nhikwakwanye ilhe?” <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />Yoyo mwaha wonkhaye uyo unaacha chittu chihinopicha utanganyia, yayo phi malheheriyo ni meettuchiho a attu. <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />We ikekhiaye, yayo malhehero ayo anoonia wiira o irusho cho uthimicha wiicheshenre aya ashinene ni wiitimarikha ni upangelha iruttu ushilhilhi. Nansho kharina machiri o uchiichiha nikakata no uhilhoka no iruttu.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />Paahi etu, inyu nhihihimushiye vamoka ni Kuristo va, muupuwelheke chittu cho uchulhu wiirimu urii awe Kuristo, unokhalha awe wiimonono wa Nlhuku. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Irusho chinyu chuupuwelheke chittu cho uchulhu wiirimu, kuhiwe chittu cho velhaponi va. <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />Ukhalhawaya mwaattiva nhokhwa ni ukumi inyu uhovithiya vamoka ni Kuristo wa Nlhuku. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Ukumi ihu nnenene phi Kuristo. Ni ikatema vanottuna awe upatakulhiya vawo ni inyu mwaatti chiicho nnoowa mwaakavihana vamoka ni uyo unthimichoni wawe.<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukumi wo khalhayi ni ukumi wo naanano wo ulhutaana ni Kuristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Paahi etu mwiiveke ittu iriyoothe yo uhilhoka irii yo velhaponi, ulhavalhava ni unanara ni wuupuwelha chittu cho uhilhoka ni nikakata no uhilhoka ni moopuwelho o uhilhoka ni nrima wo uthanana chittu niri phi uthimicha isinyago. <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo Nlhuku nowaathunalhelha onkhaye ahinomwiiwelhelha. <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Khalhayi mwaattiva mwaakhalha thoko chiicho wo uttwaraana ni mwaha wo uwonya uyo, vaatawariya inyu ni yayo.<verse eid="COL 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Nansho vano nhiyeke chechiyo chittu chiyo, urushiya ni mahuchuru ni itama yo upanga chittu cho uhilhoka ni uruwana ni malhove o uhilhoka chihikhume mena mmalhakuni mwinyu. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />Nhithepiane ukhalhawaya mwaattiva nhorulha uttu wo khalhayi ulhe vamoka ni mitheko chaya cho uhilhoka chonkhaye, <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />nhowara uttu wo naanano. Uttu unothepa urehelhelhiya ni Nlhuku, Oopilhe, wiira munlhikaanane ni unchuwelha Nlhuku wo utimira wawe. <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />Vavawo khavawo tho imwalhanne wa Ayunani ni wa Ayahudi, attu eenelhiye unyawo ni o uhiinelhiya unyawo, ntu o ushoma ni ntu o uhishoma, ipotta ama neethi. Ukhalhawaya Kuristo phi kila ittu ni wo chonkhaye.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Paahi ukhalhawaya nhothanlhiya ni Nlhuku attu ateelhihiye anttuniya, nkhalheke etu attu o ikiriri, o urera nrima, o wiitimarikha, o umaalha ni o uvilhelha. <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />Nvilhelhaneke ni uhiyererana milhatu, yakhalhaka mmoka inyu hanaa nlhatu uriyoothe wa ntunanawe thoko Athithi chuhiyerenreni aya mwaattiva. <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Uthepa yayo onkhaye ayo, mwiinanelheke uttunana, ukhalhawaya uttunana phi nolhutaaniha kila ittu ukhalha umokaru utiminre. <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Ni mpuha wa Kuristo utawareke mmamirimani mwinyu ukhalhawaya wo yoyo nlhatu uyo Nlhuku howiihanani nkhalheke ni mpuha wo iruttu yeyo imoka iyo. Tho, nkhalheke attu o ushukuru.<verse eid="COL 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />Nttenga wa Kuristo ukhalheke wo winchiva nhina mwinyu wo irusho chonkhaye. Mwiittuchihaneke ni waamukana mwiipaka izaburi ni ichipo cho untotopelha Iphumu ya Nlhuku, mwiipeke ichipo cho unthimicha Nlhuku ni unshukuru mmamirimani mwinyu. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Kila vanoolhumacha inyu nlhove ama vanopanga inyu ntheko uriwoothe, mpangeke chonkhaye wo nchina na Athithi Yesu, ni unshukuru Nlhuku Athumwanihu, wo iphiro aya.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mitheko cha attu nhina ukumi wo naanano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />Mwaatti manyoopani va, mweewelhelheke manyottato inyu, ukhalhawaya phi ittu inottuna aya Athithi.<verse eid="COL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />Ni inyu manyaalhopwana va, mwaattuneke manyaahanu inyu. Nhaachacheracheke pufia.<verse eid="COL 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Ni inyu ashaana va, mweewelhelheke manyanaangoro inyu wo chittu chonkhaye ukhalhawaya chiicho phi naachivelha Athithi.<verse eid="COL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />Ni inyu manyanaangoro, nhaathunalhihe achishaana inyu, ahiwe aakhwa nrima.<verse eid="COL 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Ni inyu ipotta va, mweewelhelheke olhupalhe inyu o velhaponi wo chittu chonkhaye ihikhalhaka weewelhelha ikatema vanoowehaayani tu wiira mwiiphwanelhihe uwannyaya. Nansho mpangeke chiicho wo nrima woombone wo nlhatu wo waathimicha Athithi. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Kila vanovara inyu ntheko, mpangeke wo nrima woombone thoko nnaapangelha Athithi ni mena kuhiwe wa ntu, <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />muupuwelhaka wiira Athithi anowa ottuvani nttuvo neeshenre aya attu aya. Nvareke ntheko waya Athithi, Kuristo! <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Ukhalhawaya ntu notteka nolhiviya uhilhoka wawe ukhalhawaya Nlhuku khanohukumulha wo ummweha ntu wiitho.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Ni inyu mwaatti mwa ashulhupalheva, mwaalhoheke ipotta chinyu wo ikiriri ni wo ikekhiaye, muupuwelhaka wiira ni inyuva chiicho nhanaa Athithi wiirimu.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Meettuchiho makina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />Munlhapelheke Nlhuku wo uhoochaa, nshiheke nlhepelhaka ni unshukuru Nlhuku. <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />Nnilhapelhelheke ni hii chiicho Nlhuku anihulhelhe nlhako wo uhimiacha nttenga uvithiye unomwacha Kuristo, urii nlhatu wo uttukiya waka, <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />wiira koorie uhimiacha thoko chinothananiya aka uhimiacha mwaari.<verse eid="COL 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />Nkhalheke ni irusho cho waarwelha attu ahinanrumelhelha Kuristo, ntumiyaka rata nipesha nirina inyu. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Malhove inyu akhalheke o nnema ikatema chonkhaye ni o waatheka attu, nchuwelha iphiro yoombone yo umwaakhulha rata kila mmoka.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isalamu cho umalhihera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />Tikiko, munnihu ninonttuna ihu, namitheko o ukhulhuvelhiya nkhunanihu wo ntheko wo Athithi awaakaru, noowa o uhimeriani mwaha aka wonkhaye. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />Kinonruma awe uwaninyu wiira ohelheni nrima wo uhimeriani mwaha wihu, <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />nowa vamoka ni Naonesimo, munnihu ottuniya ni o ukhulhuvelhiya arii mmoka inyu. Anowa o uhimeriani mwaha wo chittu chonkhaye chinopangia vaa.<verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />Aristako, ttukiye nkhunanaka, nouvahani isalamu. Ni Namako, ashivani aya Nabanaba amanlhe inyu uhimeriya malhehero anaacha, vanowa aya mwaapochereke rata. <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />Ni Nayoshua aneehaniya Yusto, anouvahani isalamu. Munlhokoni mwa Ayahudi enelhiye unyawo munrimani apinshe nrima, yalha vekha aya, phi novara ntheko vamoka ni mii wo nlhatu wo umwene wa Nlhuku ni ayo phi nokihelha nrima chinene.<verse eid="COL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Naepafra, mmoka inyu ni namitheko a Kuristo Yesu, anouvahani isalamu. Ikatema chonkhaye khanoochaa ulhapelhani mwaattiva wiira mweemelhe wo wiilhipa, nkhomaalheke ni ukhalha wo ikekhiaye wo mwaha wonkhaye unothanana awe Nlhuku. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Kinowooria uhimiechesha chineera aya wo uvara ntheko wo ukuruvalhelha wo nlhatu winyu ni wa attu o Ulaodikiya ni o Uhierapoli. <verse eid="COL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Ashinna Luka, abwana mganga ihu o uttuniya, vamoka ni Nadema ni ayo anouvahani isalamu.<verse eid="COL 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Isalamu chihu mwaavaheke ni ashilhoko ihu o Ulaodikiya. Mwaavaheke isalamu Animfa vamoka ni attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo onkhaye anokumaana unupani waya. <verse eid="COL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Mwamalhaka ushoma ilha iwarakha ilha, mwaavaheke attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo ashikhunaninyu o Ulaodikiya ni ayo ashomeke. Ni ayo mwaakakhaneke iwarakha irweehiye uwannyaya iyo ni inyu nshome. <verse eid="COL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Mweerelheke Naakipo aweheke rata ntheko uvahiye aya ni Athithi wiira atimirihe. <verse eid="COL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Mii Paolo kinouvahani isalamu chinolhepa aka wo moono aka kimwanene. Muupuwelheke uttukiya waka. Nnema wa Nlhuku ukhalhe ni inyu.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>